<title>NETHERLANDS: Oce acquires Canada's Abso Blue Prints.</title>
<headline>Oce acquires Canada's Abso Blue Prints.</headline>
<dateline>VENLO, Netherlands 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Photocopier maker Oce-van der Grinten NV said on Thursday it had acquired Canada's Abso Blue Prints Ltd.</p>
</text>
